---
const {
  title = 'A+ Active Services',
  eyebrow = 'A+ Active Services',
  heading = 'Private practices need AI workflows that actually reduce admin work.',
  intro = 'A+ Active Services helps private-practice physicians and healthcare operators reduce documentation burden, staffing pressure, and AI implementation friction without becoming AI engineers.',
} = Astro.props;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/webflow-bundle/c36a0562fb6b95e9.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/aplus-overrides.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="aplus-page-body">
    <header class="aplus-site-header">
      <a class="aplus-wordmark" href="/">A+ Active Services</a>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/masterclass">Masterclass</a>
        <a href="/healthcare-engineers">Healthcare Engineers</a>
        <a href="/wiki">Wiki</a>
        <a href="/resources">Resources</a>
        <a href="/product/growth-plan">Healthcare Software Factory</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="aplus-header-cta" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_COLLECTIVE_197" data-aplus-link="collective">Join for $197</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="aplus-page-hero">
        <div>
          <p class="aplus-kicker">{eyebrow}</p>
          <h1>{heading}</h1>
        </div>
        <p>{intro}</p>
      </section>
      <slot />
      <section class="aplus-offer-panel" aria-labelledby="aplus-shared-offer-title">
        <div class="aplus-offer-head">
          <div>
            <div class="aplus-kicker">Offering ladder</div>
            <h2 id="aplus-shared-offer-title">Start with worked examples, then buy the Healthcare Software Factory.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>The same system supports private-practice physicians, newsletter readers, paid members, masterclass attendees, office-hour prospects, and retained Healthcare Software Factory clients.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="aplus-offer-grid">
          <article class="aplus-offer-card featured">
            <span>One-time access</span>
            <h3>Healthcare Hackathon Heroes</h3>
            <strong>$197</strong>
            <p>Templates, prompts, AI Practice Audit materials, build notes, strategy games, and special access to the operating system behind A+ Active Services.</p>
            <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_COLLECTIVE_197" data-aplus-link="collective">Join for $197</a>
          </article>
          <article class="aplus-offer-card">
            <span>Weekly rhythm</span>
            <h3>Brain workouts and office hours</h3>
            <strong>Free</strong>
            <p>Weekly classes on point AI, workflow AI, compound intelligence, natural intelligence strategy games, and office hours with the trio.</p>
            <a href="https://cal.com/REPLACE_APLUS_ACTIVE" data-aplus-link="calendar">See the calendar</a>
          </article>
          <article class="aplus-offer-card">
            <span>Quarterly retainer</span>
            <h3>Healthcare Software Factory</h3>
            <strong>$3K+</strong>
            <p>The quarterly retainer turns ideas, practice data, podcast guest offers, clinic workflows, and company needs into scoped MVPs, customized prototypes, workflow audits, last-mile action plans, Podcast Guest Launch, managed LinkedIn, and bespoke consulting.</p>
            <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_FACTORY_RETAINER_3000_QTR" data-aplus-link="retainer">Start a quarter</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="aplus-visual-proof" aria-label="A+ Active proof visuals">
          <img src="/assets/cdn/69579f06-695d55bf9fdf85da8e7102af_Project-Image-1.webp" alt="Healthcare workflow prototype screen" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/assets/cdn/69579f06-695e40f235b1cf8a899e927e_Blog-Image-2.webp" alt="Healthcare workflow design notes" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/assets/cdn/69579f06-695d5c988048096869e58574_Project-Image-5.webp" alt="Healthcare software factory build" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aplus-proof-band" aria-label="A+ Active practice pain drivers">
        <div class="aplus-proof"><b>Documentation burden</b><p>Reduce after-hours charting with reviewed drafts, structured summaries, and safer handoffs.</p></div>
        <div class="aplus-proof"><b>Staffing pressure</b><p>Find front-desk, follow-up, billing, scheduling, and back-office work that AI can draft while people approve.</p></div>
        <div class="aplus-proof"><b>Implementation friction</b><p>Give IT and operators a clear first workflow, data boundary, review rule, and last-mile action plan.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="aplus-strategy-panel" aria-labelledby="aplus-shared-strategy-title">
        <div>
          <p class="aplus-kicker">Scalable acquisition</p>
          <h2 id="aplus-shared-strategy-title">Worked examples become demos. Demos become office hours. Office hours become retainers.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="aplus-strategy-steps">
          <article><span>01</span><b>Publish the worked example</b><p>Show one workflow, game, or audit artifact in public so a buyer can see the shape of the work.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><b>Run the live room</b><p>Teach the means, motivation, and opportunity behind the first small win, then answer questions live.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><b>Distribute the proof</b><p>Stream to LinkedIn, clip to YouTube, discuss in Slack, write it on Substack, and remix it for Twitter/X.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><b>Diagnose the retainer</b><p>Use discovery to move from needs to pain, impact, urgency, and a concrete Healthcare Software Factory menu item.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aplus-trio-panel" aria-labelledby="aplus-shared-trio-title">
        <div class="aplus-trio-head">
          <div>
            <div class="aplus-kicker">Proof of humanity</div>
            <h2 id="aplus-shared-trio-title">The trio behind the intelligence factory and the automation lane.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Jai shapes compound intelligence and natural intelligence. Anthony and Khizar turn the middle and back office into systems that can sell, schedule, document, and deliver.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="aplus-trio-grid">
          <article class="aplus-trio-card">
            <div class="aplus-avatar" data-aplus-trio-image="0">J</div>
            <span>Jai</span>
            <h3>Compound and natural intelligence</h3>
            <p>Uses docs, email, calendar, and brain-workout strategy games to sharpen decisions and select the first safe AI workflow to test.</p>
            <a href="https://cal.com/REPLACE_APLUS_ACTIVE" data-aplus-link="calendar">Book office hours</a>
          </article>
          <article class="aplus-trio-card">
            <div class="aplus-avatar" data-aplus-trio-image="1">K</div>
            <span>Khizar</span>
            <h3>Middle-office automation</h3>
            <p>Turns current tools, EHR-adjacent workflows, guest pipelines, content workflows, and delivery handoffs into practical systems.</p>
            <a href="https://sweetscience.substack.com/" data-aplus-link="newsletter">Follow the notes</a>
          </article>
          <article class="aplus-trio-card">
            <div class="aplus-avatar" data-aplus-trio-image="2">A+</div>
            <span>Anthony</span>
            <h3>Back-office and offer launch</h3>
            <p>Packages Podcast Guest Launch, managed LinkedIn services, and bespoke consulting around the client's current technology stack.</p>
            <a href="https://www.podcastguestlaunch.com/" data-aplus-link="podcast">See Podcast Guest Launch</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="aplus-site-footer">
      <span>Designed by Healthcare Engineers</span>
      <a href="https://sweetscience.substack.com/" data-aplus-link="newsletter">Healthcare Heroes newsletter</a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@aplusactive.com?subject=How%20we%20built%20this" data-aplus-link="inbound">Ask how we built this</a>
    </footer>
    <script is:inline src="/aplus-config.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/aplus-bindings.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
